  "14374_9443": {
   "npc": 14374,
   "page": "9443",
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\14374\\dialogue_9443.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/dungeons/dire-maul/14374/dialogue_9443.flac",
    "dur": 7.5,
    "cps": 14.8,
    "model": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base",
    "engine": "Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-Base (cuda)",
    "seed": 1763561745,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0006,
     "fr": 0.9985,
     "wer": 0.0,
     "cps": 14.8,
     "secs": 7.5,
     "sim": 0.819
    },
    "text": "Quelle horreur ! Quel drame ! Nous étions sur le point de faire une percée, mais nous risquons de tout perdre !",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "q2046501785",
     "voice_seed": 2046501785
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T02:57:23"
   }
  },
  "14381_9509": {
   "npc": 14381,
   "page": "9509",
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\14381\\dialogue_9509.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/dungeons/dire-maul/14381/dialogue_9509.flac",
    "dur": 11.5,
    "cps": 17.1,
    "model": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base",
    "engine": "Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-Base (cuda)",
    "seed": 1988910072,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0011,
     "fr": 0.998,
     "wer": 0.091,
     "cps": 17.1,
     "secs": 11.5,
     "sim": 0.863
    },
    "text": "La présence de dix mille ans de savoir accumulé a tendance à attirer des individus peu fréquentables à l’Athenaeum. Tous les jours, des livres disparaissent, sont retrouvés et sont volés à nouveau.",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "q505920766",
     "voice_seed": 505920766
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T02:57:25"
   }
  },
  "14382_9510": {
   "npc": 14382,
   "page": "9510",
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\14382\\dialogue_9510.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/dungeons/dire-maul/14382/dialogue_9510.flac",
    "dur": 16.4,
    "cps": 13.7,
    "model": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base",
    "engine": "Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-Base (cuda)",
    "seed": 2074462772,
    "scores": {
     "en": 0.0002,
     "fr": 0.9995,
     "wer": 0.135,
     "cps": 13.7,
     "secs": 16.4,
     "sim": 0.805
    },
    "text": "Kildrath a tendance à dramatiser. Par exemple : “Garona : une étude en discrétion et en trahison” a été volé plus de quatre cents fois.\n\nLa marque de l’Athenaeum protège les livres et empêche les consultations non-autorisées.",
    "stamp": {
     "voice": "q2142864777",
     "voice_seed": 2142864777
    },
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T02:57:28"
   }
  },
  "14383_9476": {
   "npc": 14383,
   "page": "9476",
   "m": {
    "file": "Interface\\AddOns\\ForeverSpeech\\audio\\14383\\dialogue_9476.ogg",
    "master": "data/audio/dungeons/dire-maul/14383/dialogue_9476.flac",
    "dur": 7.6,
    "cps": 15.9,
    "model": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base",
